====== NETGEAR R6800 ======
/* This template is intended to be used via https://openwrt.org/meta/create_new_device_page . */
//The Netgear R6800 is an AC1900 simultaneous dual band N/AC (2.4 & 5 GHz) WiFi router with three removable external antennas. It features four Gbit LAN ports, one Gbit WAN port, dual core (quad thread) MIPS CPU, 128 MB NAND flash ROM, and 256 MB RAM.//

It is based on the MT7621AT and MT7615E chips and has several clones of the same FCC ID [[https://fccid.io/PY316200344|PY316200344]]: Nighthawk AC2100 and [[toh:hwdata:netgear:netgear_ac2400|AC2400]], [[toh:netgear:r6700_v2|R6700v2]], [[toh:netgear:r6900_v2|R6900 v2]], and R7450

[[toh:netgear:r6900_v2|R6900 v2]] and R7450 support was added in 22.03.00 when this device, [[toh:netgear:r6700_v2|R6700 v2]], and AC2400 were already supported. Differences in clones include no USB 2.0 port and a Guest WiFi LED replacing the USB 2.0 LED.

