==== Opening the case ====

Netgear R6800 case have five screws: four torx under leg tape (red mark on photo) and one secure torx in the middle (green). After screws removal, top case can be removed easily.

==== Serial ====
-> [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial]] general information about the serial port, serial port cable, etc.

Serial connector isn't connected to CPU by default. Is required to solder two jumpers on resistors: R195, R26.

JP1 connector:\\
^ pin   | function      |
^ 1     | Vcc (~3.3V)            |
^ 2     | RX           |
^ 3     | TX   |
^ 4     | GND             |

{{:media:netgear:r6800_serial.jpg?400|Netgear R6800 JP1 Connector}}


^ Serial connection parameters\\ for Netgear R6800 | JP1: 57600, 8N1 |

